{
  "$comment": "AGENT_ROUTING_POLICY (machine form) and the single file-ownership table (replaces PROJECT_CONFIG.file_ownership). The router picks the smallest team: the owner of the riskiest matched domain, plus the reviewers the authority level requires, plus specialists only when a domain tag calls for them. Every member carries a reason. Executors map a role to how it actually runs.",
